  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一套由 Serilum 製作的模組。滿懷心意打造。支援 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 的大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>羊毛調整（Wool Tweaks）對羊毛、床和地毯的染色進行了多項調整。任何顏色的羊毛都可以在合成欄中染色，不再僅限於白色。你也可以手持染料右鍵點擊已放置的方塊來改變其顏色。此外，本模組還包含將任何顏色的羊毛轉換為 4 條線的配方。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>手持染料右鍵點擊世界中的任何羊毛方塊即可轉換：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示劇透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>手持染料右鍵點擊世界中的任何床方塊即可轉換：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示劇透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"560\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>手持染料右鍵點擊世界中的任何地毯方塊即可轉換：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示劇透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>將任何羊毛方塊合成為 4 條線：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>將任何羊毛方塊染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>將任何床染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>將任何地毯染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可自由將此模組用於任何模組包中，但前提是下載連結必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概述與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
